<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<mtmd:ModelingTaskMetaData xmlns:stc="http://ssp-standard.org/SSPTraceability1/SSPTraceabilityCommon" xmlns:mtmd="http://ssp-standard.org/SSPTraceability1/ModelingTaskMetaData" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:ssc="http://ssp-standard.org/SSP1/SystemStructureCommon" version="1.0.0" name="ElectricRange_V2 Modelling Task" GUID="17f9caa2-36a1-4b02-a9de-e07669e50c34" generationTool="LOTAR 2026 worked example (Claude)" generationDateAndTime="2026-08-07T00:00:00Z">
  <mtmd:GeneralInformation><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_gi1"><stc:Content>Modelling task record for EVExample.FMUs.Intermediate.ElectricRange_V2 (lumped electrical/mechanical/thermal EV range physics model). Reused unchanged from the MBI LLC supplier-validated component library for this task; range/efficiency behaviour is exercised, not re-implemented.</stc:Content></stc:Resource><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="DecisionTask.dtmd" xlink:type="simple"/><stc:Classification type="org.credible-process.core"><stc:ClassificationEntry keyword="model-validation.mode">internal</stc:ClassificationEntry></stc:Classification></mtmd:GeneralInformation>
  <mtmd:AnalysisPhase>
    <mtmd:AnalyzeModelingTaskAndObjectives><stc:Input><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_an_in"><stc:Content>DecisionTask.dtmd DefineSubTasks output and SimulationTask.stmd ImplementModel step, scoping EVExample.FMUs.Intermediate.ElectricRange_V2 as a sub-task of the range-substantiation simulation task.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_an_proc"><stc:Content>Reviewed EVExample.FMUs.Intermediate.ElectricRange_V2's role in the overall task against ControllerAndModelInterfaces.md and the SRMD's stated question of interest.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_an_out"><stc:Content>Modelling objective: confirming the reused model's fidelity and interface meet this task's architecture-level requirements without modification.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_an_rat"><stc:Content>Reused unchanged from the MBI LLC supplier-validated component library for this task; range/efficiency behaviour is exercised, not re-implemented.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-06-20T09:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:AnalyzeModelingTaskAndObjectives>
    <mtmd:VerifyAnalysis><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_an_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_va_proc"><stc:Content>Independent read-through of the modelling objective against the spawning STMD's ImplementModel step.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_va_out"><stc:Content>Sign-off memo: modelling objective is traceable and consistent with the task-level requirement.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_va_rat"><stc:Content>Independent check before Requirements work begins.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-06-20T11:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Verification and Validation Engineer" name="P. Lindqvist"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:VerifyAnalysis>
  </mtmd:AnalysisPhase>
  <mtmd:RequirementsPhase>
    <mtmd:DefineModelRequirements><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_an_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dmr_proc"><stc:Content>Derived from confirming the reused model's fidelity and interface meet this task's architecture-level requirements without modification.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dmr_out"><stc:Content>Model requirements: lumped electrical/mechanical/thermal representation sufficient for architecture-level range estimation; must expose T_in/tau_brake_ref2/tau_ref_in inputs and acceleration/position/velocity outputs per ControllerAndModelInterfaces.md; must support the batteryOption enumeration (Standard/Extended/ExtendedPlus).</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dmr_rat"><stc:Content>Restates the existing model's already-validated capability rather than proposing changes, consistent with the reuse decision in SimulationTask.stmd's DefineModelDesignSpecification.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-06-20T13:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:DefineModelRequirements>
    <mtmd:DefineParameterRequirements><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dmr_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dpr_proc"><stc:Content>Identified parameters needing documented uncertainty/variant bounds.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dpr_out"><stc:Content>Parameter requirements: P_nom, converter_eta, m, w_nom, cv, batteryOption, FourWheelDrive, HighPowerOption -- all already exposed as ssv:Parameter entries; SoC_max must be overridable per battery-degradation variant.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dpr_rat"><stc:Content>Matches the parameter set already exercised by the spawning STMD's DefineParameterRequirements step.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-06-20T14:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:DefineParameterRequirements>
    <mtmd:DefineSimulationEnvironmentRequirements><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dmr_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dser_proc"><stc:Content>Derived from the company code-verification standard.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dser_out"><stc:Content>FMI 2.0 Co-Simulation, Optimica Compiler Toolkit, adaptive solver tolerance &lt;=1e-6, matching the packaged modelDescription.xml.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dser_rat"><stc:Content>Consistent with the task-level environment requirement.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-06-20T15:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:DefineSimulationEnvironmentRequirements>
    <mtmd:DefineSimulationIntegrationRequirements><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dmr_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dsir_proc"><stc:Content>Reviewed the model's causal signal interface against ControllerAndModelInterfaces.md.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dsir_out"><stc:Content>Integration requirements: top-level component in both SystemStructure.ssd and EVRangeExampleNEDC.ssd, downstream of the Controllers subsystem.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dsir_rat"><stc:Content>Matches the interface already wired in SystemStructure.ssd.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-06-20T16:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:DefineSimulationIntegrationRequirements>
    <mtmd:DefineTestCaseRequirements><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dmr_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dtcr_proc"><stc:Content>Derived acceptance criteria for this model from the task-level test cases it participates in.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dtcr_out"><stc:Content>Test-case requirements: must produce stable, non-divergent results across all 3 task-level test cases (baseline/aggressive-regen/degraded-battery) without modification.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dtcr_rat"><stc:Content>Model-level test criteria are a refinement of, not a replacement for, the task-level test cases defined in SimulationTask.stmd.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-06-20T17:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:DefineTestCaseRequirements>
    <mtmd:DefineQualityAssuranceRequirements><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dtcr_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dqar_proc"><stc:Content>Applied the task-level QA plan at model granularity.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dqar_out"><stc:Content>QA plan: independent verification review at end of Requirements and Design; independent setup/results review before integration.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dqar_rat"><stc:Content>Mirrors SimulationTask.stmd's DefineQualityAssuranceRequirements, scoped to this model.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-06-20T18:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Verification and Validation Engineer" name="P. Lindqvist"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:DefineQualityAssuranceRequirements>
    <mtmd:VerifyRequirements><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dmr_out"/><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dpr_out"/><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dser_out"/><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dsir_out"/><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dtcr_out"/><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dqar_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_vr_proc"><stc:Content>Independent QA cross-check of all model-level Requirements outputs.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_vr_out"><stc:Content>Requirements sign-off memo: no open issues.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_vr_rat"><stc:Content>Gates entry into Design.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-06-21T09:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Verification and Validation Engineer" name="P. Lindqvist"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:VerifyRequirements>
  </mtmd:RequirementsPhase>
  <mtmd:DesignPhase>
    <mtmd:DefineModelDesignSpecification><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dmr_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dmds_proc"><stc:Content>Confirmed the existing model structure (as packaged in ElectricRange_V2-1.fmu) already satisfies DefineModelRequirements; no structural change designed.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dmds_out"><stc:Content>Design decision: no design change. The existing, previously-validated model structure is retained as-is (model-component-fit target level 4 / status level 2 per the SRMD).</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dmds_rat"><stc:Content>Reusing a validated component without modification is the lowest-risk design choice available and matches this task's R3 rationale (novelty is concentrated in the control strategy, not the range physics model).</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-06-23T09:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:DefineModelDesignSpecification>
    <mtmd:DefineParameterDesignSpecification><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dpr_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dpds_proc"><stc:Content>Mapped parameter requirements onto the ssv:ParameterSet / easySSP:ParameterContainer mechanism.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dpds_out"><stc:Content>Parameter design: default (Standard-battery) parameter set plus the battery-variant overrides sourced from resources/Standard Battery Parameters.ssv and resources/Extended Battery Options.ssv, exactly as already structured in SystemStructure.ssd.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dpds_rat"><stc:Content>Reuses the existing variant-container pattern.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-06-23T11:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:DefineParameterDesignSpecification>
    <mtmd:DefineSimulationEnvironmentDesignSpecification><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dser_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dsends_proc"><stc:Content>Pinned the exact tool/solver combination recorded in the packaged modelDescription.xml.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dsends_out"><stc:Content>Optimica Compiler Toolkit, CVode-class adaptive solver, tolerance 1e-6.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dsends_rat"><stc:Content>Required for archival re-executability.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-06-24T09:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:DefineSimulationEnvironmentDesignSpecification>
    <mtmd:DefineSimulationIntegrationDesignSpecification><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dsir_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dsids_proc"><stc:Content>Confirmed the model's connector wiring against SystemStructure.ssd.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dsids_out"><stc:Content>Integration design: top-level Component wired to the Controllers subsystem outputs (tau_brake_ref, tau_ref_rear[1]-&gt;tau_ref_in) and to acceleration/position/velocity top-level Connectors, exactly as implemented in SystemStructure.ssd.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dsids_rat"><stc:Content>Confirms the existing wiring satisfies the requirement.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-06-24T11:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:DefineSimulationIntegrationDesignSpecification>
    <mtmd:DefineTestCaseDesignSpecification><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dtcr_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dtcds_proc"><stc:Content>Mapped model-level test criteria onto the task-level run folders.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dtcds_out"><stc:Content>Test-case design: exercised by all 3 task-level runs (simulation1/2/3) without any model-specific harness.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dtcds_rat"><stc:Content>Consistent with SimulationTask.stmd's DefineTestCaseDesignSpecification.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-06-25T09:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:DefineTestCaseDesignSpecification>
    <mtmd:DefineQualityAssuranceDesignSpecification><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dqar_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dqads_proc"><stc:Content>Turned the model-level QA plan into concrete criteria.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dqads_out"><stc:Content>Checklist: modelDescription.xml declares fmiVersion 2.0 and CoSimulation; connector units match; parameter defaults documented.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_dqads_rat"><stc:Content>Model-specific refinement of the task-level QA checklist.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-06-25T11:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Verification and Validation Engineer" name="P. Lindqvist"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:DefineQualityAssuranceDesignSpecification>
    <mtmd:VerifyDesignSpecification><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dmds_out"/><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dpds_out"/><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dsends_out"/><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dsids_out"/><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dtcds_out"/><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dqads_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_vds_proc"><stc:Content>Independent design review.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_vds_out"><stc:Content>Design sign-off memo: no open issues.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_vds_rat"><stc:Content>Gates entry into Implementation.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-06-26T09:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Verification and Validation Engineer" name="P. Lindqvist"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:VerifyDesignSpecification>
  </mtmd:DesignPhase>
  <mtmd:ImplementationPhase>
    <mtmd:ImplementModel><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dmds_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_im_proc"><stc:Content>No source or FMU changes made; implementation step confirms the packaged FMU is the exact, unmodified artefact referenced by both SystemStructure.ssd and EVRangeExampleNEDC.ssd.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="model" type="application/x-fmu-sharedlibrary" id="id_er_im_out"><stc:Content>Packaged Optimica Compiler Toolkit-compiled FMI 2.0 CoSimulation FMU, resources/ElectricRange_V2-1.fmu (archive top-level resources/ directory; not referenced by relative path here since it sits outside this MTMD's own extra/org.ssp-standard.ssp-traceability.mtmd/ folder).</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_im_rat"><stc:Content>Confirming non-modification is itself the implementation record for a reused component, and is what makes the 'no new model risk' claim in this task's DecisionTask.dtmd auditable rather than assumed.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-07-01T09:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:ImplementModel>
    <mtmd:ImplementParameter><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dpds_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_ip_proc"><stc:Content>Committed the designed parameter sets into the packaged SSD/SSV files.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_ip_out"><stc:Content>Confirmed: all 5 battery/controller parameter-set variants reference this model's parameters correctly (cross-checked against SystemStructure.ssd's ssd:ParameterBindings).</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_ip_rat"><stc:Content>Keeps the archived package self-contained.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-07-01T11:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:ImplementParameter>
    <mtmd:ImplementSimulationEnvironment><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dsends_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_ise_proc"><stc:Content>Confirmed the packaged FMU matches the pinned environment design.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_ise_out"><stc:Content>Confirmed: ElectricRange_V2-1.fmu, generationTool="Optimica Compiler Toolkit", FMI 2.0 CoSimulation.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_ise_rat"><stc:Content>Required for MTMD's own archival re-executability.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-07-01T13:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:ImplementSimulationEnvironment>
    <mtmd:ImplementTestCase><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dtcds_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_itc_proc"><stc:Content>Confirmed the model-level test criteria are exercised by the shared task-level config.json run definitions.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_itc_out"><stc:Content>No model-specific test harness needed beyond the shared task-level runs; criteria satisfied by simulation1/2/3.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_itc_rat"><stc:Content>Avoids duplicating test infrastructure already implemented at task level.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-07-01T15:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:ImplementTestCase>
    <mtmd:IntegrateSimulation><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_dsids_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_is_proc"><stc:Content>Confirmed the model's connectors resolve correctly inside SystemStructure.ssd's ssd:Connections.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_is_out"><stc:Content>Confirmed: all connectors used by this model are wired and unit-consistent in the integrated SSD.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_is_rat"><stc:Content>Model-level confirmation of the task-level integration work.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-07-02T09:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:IntegrateSimulation>
    <mtmd:AssureSimulationSetupQuality><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_er_is_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_assq_proc"><stc:Content>Ran the model-level QA checklist.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_assq_out"><stc:Content>Setup QA memo: 0 defects found for this model's contribution to the integrated setup.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_er_assq_rat"><stc:Content>Clean setup QA supports proceeding to task-level execution.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-07-02T11:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Verification and Validation Engineer" name="P. Lindqvist"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"/></stc:Approved></stc:LifeCycleInformation></mtmd:AssureSimulationSetupQuality>
